{"coverage":2449,"partial":false,"day_closed":true,"window":"00:00–23:46","movers":[{"symbol":"LCCPROJECT","ticker":"LCCPROJECT","company":"LCC Projects Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 703.00 cr; ~17.8% of mcap","headline":"receives an 18-month LOI from the Gujarat Water Supply and Sewerage Board for an EPC water-supply scheme (intake well, rising mains, pumping machinery, SCADA) based on the Bhadbhut Barrage, Bharuch","amount_rs":7030000000,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LCCPROJECTS_03112026110231_Reg30_LOI_03112026_SIGNED.pdf","mcap":3654.8,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LCCPROJECTS_03112026110231_Reg30_LOI_03112026_SIGNED.pdf"},{"symbol":"HILINFRA","ticker":"HILINFRA","company":"Highway Infrastructure Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 198.31 cr; ~38.6% of mcap","headline":"receives a Letter of Award from CPWD for Phase-I residential and non-residential infrastructure at a CISF Reserve Battalion, Sehore (MP), on EPC mode","amount_rs":1983099984,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/HIGHWAY123_03112026202950_HIL_Reg30_Cover_CPWD.pdf","mcap":577.9,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/HIGHWAY123_03112026202950_HIL_Reg30_Cover_CPWD.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Slone Infosystems** — Rs 4.29 cr order (incl. GST) from RAH Infotech to supply 700 Lenovo V14 laptops, to be executed immediately _(~6.2% of mcap)_.","**KPI Green Energy** — executes a Power Purchase Agreement with SJVN for a 300 MW ISTS-connected wind power project; the filing states no rupee value.","**Maestros Electronics & Telecommunications** — Rs 1.67 cr purchase order (ex-tax) from Mazagon Dock for 81 telemedicine units on four Indian Navy ships, delivery by 3 Mar 2027 _(~2.0% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**JNK India** — receives a 'Major' order (the company's Rs 300-600 cr band) from its promoter JNK Global, Korea, for a heater package for a Nigerian project, 18-month delivery; band floor Rs 300 cr.","**AVG Logistics** — wins a five-year vehicle-deployment transportation contract from a multinational beverage company, expecting about Rs 60 cr revenue over the term (mcap ratio not computed, no mcap in store).","**Krsnaa Diagnostics** — receives a Letter of Award from the Municipal Corporation of Delhi for a 10-year (extendable by 5) cash-collection PPP to run CT scan and MRI facilities at three Delhi hospitals; value not stated.","**OSEL Devices** — signs a concession agreement with ITPO, a Government of India enterprise, to design, supply, install and operate digital LED screens at Bharat Mandapam, New Delhi, under PPP; value not stated."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Crescentis Capital** — Board approves the Letter of Offer for a Rs 79.62 cr rights issue at Rs 78 a share (Rs 68 premium), 3 for every 5 held, record date 4 Nov.","**Zodiac-JRD-MKJ** — receives BSE in-principle approval for its Rs 40 cr rights issue (approved 6 Aug); price and ratio still to be fixed by the Board, so the raise is not yet priced.","**Camlin Fine Sciences** — Board approves a rights issue of up to Rs 250 cr; price, ratio and record date are to be fixed later by a Board committee, subject to approvals.","**Acetech E-Commerce** — Board approves a rights issue of up to Rs 40 cr (terms to follow) and, separately, buys 70% of Unique Cookware (India) for Rs 10.41 cr cash.","**Simplex Castings** — receives BSE in-principle approval for a preferential issue of 44,90,791 equity shares and 50,05,195 convertible warrants; the filing gives no price or rupee total.","**Shlokka Dyes** — Board proposes up to 39,00,000 convertible warrants on preferential basis to promoter group and public, exercisable within 18 months; subject to shareholder approval, so still proposed."],"equity_allotments":["**Systematic Industries** — allots 14,57,400 equity shares at Rs 228 (Rs 33.22 cr) to promoter-group and non-promoter allottees, partly in cash and partly as a share swap for 99.96% of Wire Brigade Industries (new_share_allotment).","**Abhinav Leasing & Finance** — Board approves allotment of 6,00,00,000 convertible warrants at Rs 1 each (Rs 6 cr in cash) to non-promoter entities (new_warrant).","**Digikore Studios** — corrects its 25-Jun disclosure: the promoter was allotted 5,14,800 shares on converting a Rs 4.00 cr loan (Rs 3,99,99,960), not the figures first filed (new_share_allotment).","**Emrock Corporation** — allots 74,35,491 equity shares on conversion of warrants issued at Rs 11 each in May 2025 (warrant_conversion_past)."],"m_and_a":["**Arkade Developers** — completes the cash acquisition of 100% of Woollen & Textile Industries for Rs 145.51 cr, a 14,363.60 sq m Bhandup (West) land parcel with a company-estimated GDV of Rs 1,800 cr.","**Fractal Analytics** — step-down unit Asper.AI buys the pricing software IP and certain liabilities of Pricing One SA for about CHF 1.32 mn (Rs 15.21 cr per the filing), completed.","**Hindustan Aeronautics** — HATSOFF Helicopter Training's board approves transfer of CAE Canada's 3,84,04,205 shares (50%) to HAL, making it a wholly-owned subsidiary; price not stated.","**Kotak Mahindra Bank** — a regulator conveys approval for its acquisition of Deutsche Bank AG's India retail, private banking and wealth business; completion awaits remaining conditions and approvals; no value stated here.","**Amber Enterprises** — material subsidiary IL JIN completes the share-swap buyout of the remaining stake in Power-One Micro Systems, issuing 1,76,000 CCPS A3 as non-cash consideration; Power-One becomes wholly owned.","**Brainbees Solutions (FirstCry)** — material subsidiary Globalbees acquires a further stake in Better & Brighter Homecare (Absorbia moisture absorbers, FY26 turnover Rs 8.83 cr)."],"capex_core":["**Global Health (Medanta)** — Board approves a Rs 997 cr project budget, land included, for a 500-bed hospital on a 10,560 sq m UPAVP plot at Siddharth Vihar, Ghaziabad.","**Aelea Commodities** — Board approves buying land at Vasravi, Surat to add 60 MT capacity, plus a staff housing colony; total investment Rs 114 cr (Rs 100 cr plants and land, Rs 14 cr housing), 30 months from Feb 2027."],"business_updates":["**Embassy Developments** — Q2 FY27 pre-sales hit a record Rs 3,225 cr, up 272% QoQ; H1 pre-sales Rs 4,093 cr (up 574% YoY, 51% of FY27 guidance); collections Rs 546 cr.","**BLS International** — Q2 FY27 revenue a record Rs 973 cr; H1 revenue up 28.7% to Rs 1,863 cr, H1 EBITDA up 20.0% to Rs 500 cr.","**Metropolis Healthcare** — Q2 FY27 revenue up 16% to Rs 497 cr, EBITDA up 24% to Rs 135 cr, PAT up 43% to Rs 75 cr; patient volume up 10% to 4.1 mn.","**Datamatics Global Services** — Q2 FY27 revenue up 11.5% YoY to Rs 546.6 cr, PAT up 16.1% to Rs 73.4 cr.","**Aaron Industries** — October 2026 sales a record Rs 11.66 cr (provisional, unaudited).","**Indian Energy Exchange** — October 2026 traded volume 13,092 MU, up 16.5% YoY; day-ahead clearing price up 149% to Rs 6.66/unit from Rs 2.67.","**Kasturi Metal Composite** — H1 FY27 operational update: revenue from operations Rs 30.46 cr, 4.9% below H1 FY26, and group profit after tax Rs 1.20 cr (SME, half-yearly filer).","**Allcargo Terminals** — October 2026 volumes 68.2 thousand TEUs, up 4% YoY and 10% on the month."],"distress_risk":["**Quadrant Televentures** — NCLT Mumbai Bench-I allows the resolution plan on 3 Nov; the written order is awaited.","**Diffusion Engineers** — wins its GST appeal: the Appellate Authority sets aside a Rs 72.14 lakh ITC demand with interest and an equal penalty."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk",